---
config:
  theme: redux
  look: classic
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open template marketplace]
    B --> C[Search or filter templates]
    C --> D{Matching templates found?}

    D -- No --> E[Adjust search or filters]
    E --> C

    D -- Yes --> F[Open template details]
    F --> G[Review description, preview, and requirements]
    G --> H{Use this template?}

    H -- No --> C
    H -- Yes --> I[Select Use This Template]
    I --> J[Open conversion workspace]
    J --> K[Template is selected]
    K --> L([End])